WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.690
<i>What Sara said might be true.</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.150
<i>The Kadun of Destruction that we, the outsiders, brought...</i>

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.910
<i>...took the stars away from the Mayan island,</i>

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:17.830
<i>took away blood,</i>

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:19.950
<i>took away lives,</i>

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:26.080
<i>and the daisy cutter scorched the rich soil.</i>

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:31.620
<i>Then the birdman's head appeared
from the burned ground.</i>

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>And we, who were finally reunited...</i>

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.260
Captain!

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.140
Shin!

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:39.850
AFOS!

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.680
<i>We've lost our...</i>

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:51.520
<i>loved ones.</i>

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:54.530
Sara!

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:54.950
Get down!

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:04.030
Sara!

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:38.110
We have the head now.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:41.870
Sara, please awaken the birdman.

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:45.660
If the birdman awakens, it will
sing the Song of Destruction.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:47.120
The Winds of Destruction will blow!

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:52.290
Destruction and creation are just
two faces of the same Kadun.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:59.800
When that power is used for destruction,
you call it the Song of Destruction,

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:05.390
and when the same power is used for creation
you call it the Song of Creation.

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:09.560
The song is more than just simple vibrations of the air.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:12.360
Beyond space, beyond time,

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:17.770
the matter that moves all souls is called the True Song.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:24.870
Since ancient times, the aliens who came to Earth have
modified human DNA with the birdman's help,

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:27.330
and forced us to evolve.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:33.290
That's why we need its power to suppress this chaos.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:40.930
It's your duty as a priestess to awaken
the birdman and restore peace, Sara.

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:42.300
But you burned the forest!

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:47.060
What if it was the UN forces that
had used the daisy cutter?

00:02:53.650 --> 00:03:00.030
Both the UN and the Anti-UN Alliance acquired
a piece of the puzzle called AFOS.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:07.540
Once another battle starts, it will
be bloody hell trying to steal it.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:11.540
Shin!

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:13.620
Rescue my sister!

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:19.090
Mao! Are you better already?

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:20.460
I'm fine!

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.340
Don't mind me, Shin.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:25.600
The birdman's body will call out for its head.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.380
I can tell since I was reborn in the Kinuha.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.770
There's a change in its nervous system.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.360
It looks like it's some sort of data.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.860
You seem very shocked.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:49.580
Sara!

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:50.290
Aries!

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:55.290
I know about Operation Iconoclasm.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:04:01.840
Why don't you tell this innocent
island girl how dirty the UN is?

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:05.800
What were you going to do when you realized
you couldn't get the birdman?

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.020
Destroy it completely.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.850
That's the top secret operation, Iconoclasm.

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:23.610
That's why I was trying to rush the
search for AFOS, or the birdman.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.780
The nation, the land, and the people's lives...

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.750
They destroy anything they can't acquire for themselves.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:33.040
That's how the UN does business.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.290
No...

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:43.300
Sara! Don't listen to them!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.300
There's an energy movement in AFOS.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:51.270
It's detecting the unidentified electron
vector and the gravitational force.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.270
The internal temperature is rising.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:55.770
Man, just when the Doctor is gone...

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:05.910
Shin, the birdman is awakening!

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:07.030
Please, stop it!

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.450
The heck with the birdman!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.040
I just have to rescue Sara from them!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:16.750
But, Shin, to stop the birdman from
singing the Song of Destruction,

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:18.750
she's going to kill herself.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:21.880
Kudou,

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:27.880
you've got to give up your life for a woman
at least once in your lifetime.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:31.650
Yes.

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.140
My sister is waiting for you, Shin!

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.360
She's waiting, Shin...

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.580
We are ascending.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.410
Downtrim 30 degrees.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.740
Engine full power!

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.580
Quickly, blow out the rear tank.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:01.290
Lower the bow!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.160
We're still ascending!

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:06.130
5 meters to the surface.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:06.920
4 meters.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:07.800
3.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:09.090
2.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:09.800
1.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:19.810
What's going on?!

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:22.570
This ship is now in the air!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:47.040
I tuned it to the max just for you.

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:49.550
I also loaded her up with plenty of ammo.

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.630
Thank you very much, Chief.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:05.060
I love idiots who risk their lives for women.

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:08.780
Skull One, Skull Two, you do not
have permission to take off.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:10.950
This is Skull Leader.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:12.160
This is an emergency!

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.740
Check on us later!

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:14.820
I can't do—

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.590
Skull Leader, you have permission to take off.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.500
Edgar!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.590
I failed to die again.

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:30.050
Why you...

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.640
Shin, will you write me a message when you get back?

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.650
Yeah, I promise.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.310
OK!

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:45.520
Skull One, Skull Two, catapult is clear.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:46.940
Go for it!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.250
Shin! Look!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.180
High energy levels detected from AFOS!

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.050
This ship just lifted off from the surface!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.470
What's going on?

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:28.980
Captain!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.530
It's AFOS!

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:34.740
AFOS is overriding the system, and controlling gravity!

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:39.080
Even one part of AFOS has incredible power.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:43.080
Do anything to get the piece that the enemy stole!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:47.090
This power will decide the winner.

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:54.590
Look!

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:57.850
There will be another battle because
you're not decisive enough.

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.890
More lives will be wasted.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.630
Yet again,  lives...

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:45.810
So many Kadun...

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:47.150
Can you feel it, Mao?

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:50.520
Yeah. Everyone is going crazy.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.820
I can only see anger and fear.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.500
Shot down three!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.090
What about PC-35?

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:19.460
That's...!

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.190
The Anti-UN Alliance's fleet!

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:30.560
Even they can float with the birdman's power?

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.360
Skull Two! An enemy is approaching!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.230
7 o'clock up, 70 degrees!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.200
That bitch!

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:46.710
Even with a new machine, I can recognize
your maneuvers, boy.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:48.920
Why now?

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:51.960
Skull Two, you don't have time to fight her!

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.710
Lose her with your booster, full throttle!

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:54.710
Roger!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.760
It's not that easy.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.220
Let's go!

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:14.020
Damn!

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.900
1.5, 1.6, 1.7...

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.400
It's over the instrument's limit.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:24.660
Dance, dance, dance!

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.330
Gotcha!

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:38.170
Captain Focker!

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:38.880
Idiot!

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:40.880
You're such a klutz.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:48.680
What?!

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:50.440
DD Ivanov!

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.850
Sorry to make you wait, Nora.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.270
DD!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:55.940
The fun starts right now.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.320
Sounds good.

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.850
You take him.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:00.450
I'll take the boy.

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:02.150
Two on two, huh?

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.090
There's no end.

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:22.930
That's it!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:28.970
Going to transform?

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:29.680
Fun.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.980
Good going, Shin!

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:12.600
Slow down!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:15.350
Shit!

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:35.370
Sara, do you want the island that your
father loved so much to be burned?

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.670
Don't mention my father's name!

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:39.880
You tricked me!

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:43.550
People's minds are weak.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:49.390
Ugai asked me to test if you'd be
cursed by the Kadun or not.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.020
And you...

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:54.270
...could not resist the temptation.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.390
You broke the policy.

00:13:57.770 --> 00:13:58.900
Right?

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.410
I caught EC-3's sound.

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:12.910
Sara!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:19.920
Even if the Mayan people are annihilated,
we must not resurrect the birdman.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:25.420
Without the Leader of the Wind, the birdman
won't be able to sing the Song of Destruction!

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:26.470
No!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:32.890
Sara!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:34.390
Shin!

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:51.950
No!

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.950
What's wrong, Mao?

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.580
Just like the sea...

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.540
The deep sea.

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.330
The lost sadness.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:04.960
The birdman is awakening!

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.110
A malfunction in the rear!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.950
The birdman's head took off from the ship!

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.660
I can't control the ship!

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.490
The birdman connected in mid-air.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:15.200
Its energy level is rising.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:19.540
It looks like it's growing quickly by
absorbing elements from the air.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.670
I don't care if we break it a little.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.420
Get it back any way possible!

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:45.010
Was it you who sought after me?

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:47.440
Yes.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:51.980
Did mankind create a ship that
can travel between the stars?

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:53.920
Yes.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:57.740
Did mankind stop fighting?

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.580
Well...

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.120
Did they?

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.040
No.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:19.180
Those possessed by the Kadun of Battle must be
eliminated before they cause chaos across the galaxy.

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:25.940
The fear, the sadness, the pain, and
the anger that are inside people...

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:28.440
That is the true Song of Destruction.

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:32.280
Kadun!

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.690
With only one shot...

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:24.660
How could we possibly control such a monster?

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:36.380
So that's the final decision of the Supreme
Command Organization?

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:42.680
Set Operation Iconoclasm in motion!

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:47.190
Reactor bomb #1 through #4, set in place.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:50.860
The Song of Destruction will be...

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:53.190
The Flower of Death will blossom.

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:55.190
People will be annihilated.

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:56.780
We must stop it!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:19:00.780
Even the birdman really doesn't want to sing such a song!

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:02.200
Shin, can you hear me?!

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.620
It's no use.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:11.370
Your voice can't reach those who are possessed
by the Kadun of Anger and Fear.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.300
Shin, answer me!

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:17.670
Shin!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:35.280
This song... Is it Sara?

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:37.240
Calling all units.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:39.280
Operation Iconoclasm is in motion.

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.870
That's... the birdman!

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:43.910
The survival of the human race is at stake here.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.490
Destroy AFOS immediately.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.710
I can't do that!

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:50.450
Sara is trapped inside it!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.750
That bitch again?!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.260
I won't let you get away this time.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:10.940
Look... Look at how the world will be destroyed.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:20.020
Northern European mythology,
Mayan, Aztec, Indian, Egyptian,

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:25.820
and all other mythologies tell the
story of the end of the world.

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:31.790
And then, a new world is born.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:40.760
The new world can only be created from the ashes
of the total destruction of the old world.

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:46.760
The current human race is a failed experimental species.

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.900
Are we really a failure?

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:57.350
Couldn't there be a new creation without destruction?

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.730
It's too late.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:10.390
The birdman has already chosen the path of destruction.

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:25.880
This is... the cave painting...

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:36.860
Wait for me, Aries.

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:39.100
What?!

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:40.730
What's wrong with you?

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:42.860
The battle isn't over yet!

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:44.570
Why now?!

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:05.760
Die.

00:22:12.270 --> 00:22:13.760
Nora, behind you!

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:33.830
How stupid...

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:36.080
This is too stupid!

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:38.460
Unforgivable!

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:42.460
Ivanov!

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:43.840
Skull Two to Skull One!

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:47.470
Captain, please hurry and rescue Aries.

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:48.840
I'll go get Sara from the birdman.

00:22:49.260 --> 00:22:51.010
It's a monster.

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:51.720
Can you do it?

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:54.680
Only Sara can stop the birdman.

00:22:55.190 --> 00:22:56.230
So I have to.

00:22:57.650 --> 00:23:00.060
Yeah, that's the spirit.

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:02.440
But one piece of advice.

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:04.190
Don't die.

00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:07.110
Roger.

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:09.070
Good luck to you too, Captain.

00:23:14.500 --> 00:23:15.830
Damn fledgling.

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:17.240
Let's do it!

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:24.460
Aries!

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:41.310
Damn you!

00:23:47.740 --> 00:23:48.860
Shit!

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:57.500
For Nora!

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:02.500
That's...

00:24:05.280 --> 00:24:06.210
Sara!

00:24:07.300 --> 00:24:08.420
Kadun...

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:14.430
What?!

00:24:53.670 --> 00:24:54.380
Shin...

00:24:59.850 --> 00:25:00.980
Don't!

00:25:02.560 --> 00:25:03.520
Shin...

00:25:04.150 --> 00:25:09.860
You are possessed by the Kadun of Anger and Fear,
and therefore can't hear the heart's voice.

00:25:10.440 --> 00:25:12.860
Can't you hear her sorrowful voice?!

00:25:13.200 --> 00:25:16.450
But Sara is trapped inside the birdman, and...

00:25:16.450 --> 00:25:17.870
Shin, you idiot!

00:25:17.870 --> 00:25:21.540
She believed in you, Shin!

00:25:24.330 --> 00:25:25.750
She loves you...

00:25:35.010 --> 00:25:37.300
The sorrowful voice...

00:25:41.520 --> 00:25:42.810
That's right.

00:25:47.610 --> 00:25:48.770
Shin...

00:25:59.950 --> 00:26:00.660
Kadun!

00:26:04.370 --> 00:26:06.120
Sara!

00:26:11.840 --> 00:26:12.880
<i>I...</i>

00:26:14.430 --> 00:26:15.050
<i>believe...</i>

00:26:17.180 --> 00:26:18.180
<i>in you.</i>

00:26:37.490 --> 00:26:39.990
Sara!

00:26:39.990 --> 00:26:41.330
Shin...

00:26:58.510 --> 00:27:00.300
Sara, it's me!

00:27:00.300 --> 00:27:01.010
Wake up!

00:27:02.890 --> 00:27:06.020
Shin... You're alive!

00:27:06.480 --> 00:27:07.310
Sara!

00:27:08.270 --> 00:27:10.810
Shin, you really came for me!

00:27:18.110 --> 00:27:19.410
Sis...

00:27:54.110 --> 00:27:55.400
NO!

00:27:56.780 --> 00:27:57.400
Mao?

00:28:00.450 --> 00:28:01.160
Kadun!

00:28:01.160 --> 00:28:01.610
What?!

00:28:08.580 --> 00:28:09.780
Nuclear warheads!

00:28:10.130 --> 00:28:12.830
Their fallout will spread over the Mayan island too!

00:28:13.500 --> 00:28:17.670
Thank you, Shin, for believing in me.

00:28:24.920 --> 00:28:25.640
Sara!

00:28:26.180 --> 00:28:28.010
Shin, please...

00:28:29.140 --> 00:28:30.640
Look after the Mayan people.

00:28:30.640 --> 00:28:31.810
Sara!

00:29:14.980 --> 00:29:16.180
She's gone...

00:29:24.490 --> 00:29:25.610
Focker...

00:29:26.320 --> 00:29:29.740
Doctor said it's impossible...

00:29:29.740 --> 00:29:31.910
Enough. Don't talk anymore.

00:29:33.120 --> 00:29:38.000
Saving the world is a simple task.

00:29:38.980 --> 00:29:39.840
Aries!

00:29:41.670 --> 00:29:42.550
Roy,

00:29:46.010 --> 00:29:47.800
I love you.

00:29:51.430 --> 00:29:52.890
See?

00:29:52.890 --> 00:29:55.050
Isn't it simple?

00:29:59.440 --> 00:30:00.150
Aries!

00:30:16.790 --> 00:30:18.620
The machine isn't responding.

00:30:20.710 --> 00:30:23.210
The ejection system is broken, too.

00:30:25.470 --> 00:30:27.340
<i>I'm sorry, Sara.</i>

00:30:28.220 --> 00:30:32.890
<i>Even after saving the island and the world,
even at the cost of your own life...</i>

00:30:33.600 --> 00:30:34.260
<i>I...</i>

00:30:35.440 --> 00:30:36.470
<i>I...</i>

00:31:04.460 --> 00:31:06.880
I can hear it, Sara.

00:31:07.920 --> 00:31:12.640
The song of you, and of the Mayan people.

00:31:43.460 --> 00:31:44.380
Mao!

00:32:06.780 --> 00:32:07.860
The flying fish!

00:32:26.130 --> 00:32:29.050
You really are a birdman, Shin.

00:32:35.680 --> 00:32:41.790
Dans le calme du soir

00:32:35.680 --> 00:32:41.790
In the calm of the evening...

00:32:41.900 --> 00:32:47.530
Lève les yeux afin du voir

00:32:41.900 --> 00:32:47.530
Raise your eyes to see...

00:32:47.950 --> 00:32:54.030
Apparaître et scintiller

00:32:47.950 --> 00:32:54.030
Appearing and shining...

00:32:54.140 --> 00:33:01.620
Toutes les étoiles

00:32:54.140 --> 00:33:01.620
All the stars.

00:32:56.410 --> 00:33:04.500
Final Chapter

00:32:56.410 --> 00:33:04.500
Birdman

00:33:04.740 --> 00:33:15.650
Dans leur repos brillent leur coeurs

00:33:04.740 --> 00:33:15.650
In their rest their hearts shine...

00:33:16.170 --> 00:33:26.750
Et leur dire "la terre sera malade"

00:33:16.170 --> 00:33:26.750
And their words 'the world will be ill'...

00:33:27.530 --> 00:33:38.600
Ainsi la mer refletera

00:33:27.530 --> 00:33:38.600
And there will be reflections in the sea...

00:33:38.940 --> 00:33:50.110
Qui s'élève la finir sera les hommes

00:33:38.940 --> 00:33:50.110
And those who can rise to end it will be men.

00:33:51.500 --> 00:33:53.920
Dans le calme du soir

00:33:51.500 --> 00:33:53.920
In the calm of the evening...

00:33:56.270 --> 00:34:02.190
Lève les yeux afin du voir

00:33:56.270 --> 00:34:02.190
Raise your eyes to see...

00:34:02.410 --> 00:34:07.910
Apparaître et scintiller

00:34:02.410 --> 00:34:07.910
Appearing and shining...

00:34:08.500 --> 00:34:17.200
Toutes les étoiles

00:34:08.500 --> 00:34:17.200
All the stars.
